{"id":"n23556-1-7","stage":4,"title":"기린 · 长颈鹿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23556-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 저기 기린 좀 봐.","zh":"智秀，快看那边的长颈鹿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"기린","meaning":"长颈鹿","explanation":"기린：长颈鹿。","readings":[{"term":"기린","audio":"/audio/f8ca9e23b97c13054923.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23556","senseId":"1","lemma":"기린","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기린","audio":"/audio/f8ca9e23b97c13054923.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"f8ca9e23b97c1305","term":"기린","zh":"长颈鹿","audio":"/audio/f8ca9e23b97c13054923.mp3","entryId":"23556","definition":"一种额头两侧长有短角、脖子和腿很长的动物。","pronunciation":["기린"]},{"